  (text "CIRCUIT main board - schematic status\n\nAll nine sheets are drawn as DRAFTS. Each sheet lists, in its header note, what is from memory and must be confirmed.\n\nBiggest open items: display FPC pin order (placeholder), MCU power-pin network, charger and regulator values,\nbacklight LED topology. Nothing here has been through an electrical rules check or a human review.\n\nSignals between sheets use global labels. No routing before this schematic is complete and reviewed."
